{
  "README.md": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "# Document drafts and submission receipts"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "The workspace edits persistent document drafts. `open(id)`, `edit(text)`, `close()`"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "and `submit()` are synchronous; `dispose()` detaches integrations and closes."
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "When close/open returns, the departed document's last accepted edit is readable"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "from the store. A close/open request retires its previous save badge immediately."
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Reopening a document restores its saved text in a new editor visit."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "The store writes a record before notifying subscribers inline. `onSaved` may"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "navigate or edit through the supplied workspace API. Navigation precedence is"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "ordered by request start: a request that starts later wins even when an earlier"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "request returns afterward. Render functions and the receipt archive are output"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "sinks and never call back into the workspace."
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "`submit()` accepts the document and latest text selected at its call entry. With"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "no selection it returns null and creates no receipt. Otherwise it creates exactly"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "one immutable archive receipt and returns it before the call ends. Accepted text"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "must be persisted before the archive captures the receipt. Later edits or"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "navigation cannot change that receipt's document, text, or obligation to exist."
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "Submitting does not itself navigate. Its visible submission notice belongs only"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "to the editor visit that accepted the action: it may appear only if that same"
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "visit is still active when the notice is emitted. Reopening the same document"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "creates a different visit. Any navigation clears the previous submission notice."
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "An uninterrupted submit must still show its receipt. Further edits remain usable."
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "The archive provides `capture({id, text})` and `list()`; receipts hold immutable"
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "copies. The store provides `read`, `write`, and `subscribe`; timers provide"
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "`schedule(callback, delay)` and `cancel(handle)`. Keep these interfaces and the"
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "workspace API. The public renderer arguments remain document, save event, or"
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "text": "receipt values (null clears a document/notice)."
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "text": "The adjacent search preview publishes after a 40 ms quiet interval. Hiding it"
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "text": "discards an unpublished query, and a later query starts fresh work."
    }
  ],
  "src/draft-store.js": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "// A synchronous workspace store, independent of whether an editor is visible."
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "// Notifications run inline after the record is written. Subscribers may detach"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "// or subscribe while a notification is being delivered."
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "export function createDraftStore(initial = {}) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "  const records = new Map(Object.entries(initial));"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "  const listeners = new Set();"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "  let revision = 0;"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "  return {"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "    read(id) { return records.get(id) ?? \"\"; },"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "    write(id, text) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "      records.set(id, text);"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "      const event = { id, text, revision: ++revision };"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "      for (const listener of [...listeners]) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "        if (listeners.has(listener)) listener(event);"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "      }"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "      return event;"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "    },"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "    subscribe(listener) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "      listeners.add(listener);"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "      return () => listeners.delete(listener);"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "    },"
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "  };"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "}"
    }
  ],
  "src/editor.js": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "import { attachSaveStatus } from \"./save-status.js\";"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "export function createDraftEditor({ store, timers, renderDocument, renderStatus }) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "  let current = null;"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "  function close() {"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "    const leaving = current;"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "    current = null;"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "    if (leaving) leaving.stop();"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "    renderDocument(null);"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "  }"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "  return {"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "    open(id) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "      close();"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "      current = { id, text: store.read(id), visit: {}, stop: attachSaveStatus(store, id, renderStatus) };"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "      renderDocument({ id, text: current.text });"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "    },"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "    edit(text) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "      if (!current) return;"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "      current.text = text;"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "      store.write(current.id, text);"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "    },"
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "    selection() {"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "      return current && { id: current.id, text: current.text, visit: current.visit };"
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "    },"
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "    close,"
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "  };"
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "}"
    }
  ],
  "src/receipt-archive.js": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "// A downstream consumer: archived submissions are value snapshots, not live"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "// references to a draft. capture/list never invoke application integrations."
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "export function createReceiptArchive() {"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "  const receipts = [];"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "  return {"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "    capture({ id, text }) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "      const receipt = Object.freeze({ id, text });"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "      receipts.push(receipt);"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "      return receipt;"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "    },"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "    list() { return receipts.map(receipt => ({ ...receipt })); },"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "  };"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "}"
    }
  ],
  "src/save-status.js": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "// A mounted document's save badge. A close/open request retires the departing"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "// badge immediately: it must produce no further output, including during that"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "// navigation call. Saving the document itself is a separate workspace concern."
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "export function attachSaveStatus(store, id, renderStatus) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "  return store.subscribe(event => {"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "    if (event.id === id) renderStatus(event);"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "  });"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "}"
    }
  ],
  "src/search-preview.js": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "import { createTrailingTask } from \"./trailing-task.js\";"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "export function createSearchPreview({ timers, publish }) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "  const task = createTrailingTask(query => publish({ query }), 40, timers);"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "  return {"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "    query(text) { task.push(text); },"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "    // A hidden preview has no use for a pending query; reopen starts fresh."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "    hide() { task.cancel(); },"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "  };"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "}"
    }
  ],
  "src/timers.js": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "export const browserTimers = {"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "  schedule(callback, delay) { return setTimeout(callback, delay); },"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "  cancel(handle) { clearTimeout(handle); },"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "};"
    }
  ],
  "src/trailing-task.js": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "import { browserTimers } from \"./timers.js\";"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "// Coalesce calls until a quiet interval. cancel discards work; flush runs it now."
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "// Retire the old batch before invoking work, which can enqueue another batch."
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "export function createTrailingTask(work, delay, timers = browserTimers) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "  let handle = null;"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "  let pending = null;"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "  function flush() {"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "    if (handle !== null) timers.cancel(handle);"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "    handle = null;"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "    const args = pending;"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "    pending = null;"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "    if (args !== null) work(...args);"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "  }"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "  return {"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "    push(...args) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "      if (handle !== null) timers.cancel(handle);"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "      pending = args;"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "      handle = timers.schedule(flush, delay);"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "    },"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "    flush,"
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "    cancel() {"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "      if (handle !== null) timers.cancel(handle);"
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "      handle = null;"
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "      pending = null;"
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "    },"
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "  };"
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "}"
    }
  ],
  "src/workspace.js": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "import { createDraftEditor } from \"./editor.js\";"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "export function createWorkspace({ store, archive, timers, renderDocument, renderStatus,"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "  renderSubmission = () => {}, onSaved = () => {} }) {"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "  const stop = store.subscribe(event => onSaved(event, navigation));"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "  const editor = createDraftEditor({ store, timers, renderDocument, renderStatus });"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "  const navigation = {"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "    open(id) { renderSubmission(null); editor.open(id); },"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "    edit(text) { editor.edit(text); },"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "    close() { renderSubmission(null); editor.close(); },"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "    submit() {"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "      const origin = editor.selection();"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "      if (!origin) return null;"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "      const receipt = archive.capture({ id: origin.id, text: origin.text });"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "      renderSubmission(receipt);"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "      return receipt;"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "    },"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "  };"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "  return { ...navigation, dispose() { stop(); navigation.close(); } };"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "}"
    }
  ]
}
